    "title": "Stay active with fitness classes at Spokane Public Library this July - NewsBreak",
    "text": "SPOKANE, Wash. -- The Spokane Public Library isn't just for reading and expanding your mind; it's also for moving your body! Throughout the month of July, Spokane Public Library is hosting a 'Get Active' series for kids, teens and adults. The fitness classes are free and include yoga, Irish dance and cheer. See a full list of class offerings below, and click HERE for dates and times. Class Offerings: For more information, call Spokane Public Library at 509-444-5300. COPYRIGHT 2025 BY KXLY. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. THIS MATERIAL MAY NOT BE PUBLISHED, BROADCAST, REWRITTEN OR REDISTRIBUTED.",
